==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hitomi Saionji (Enemy)|Hitomi Saionji]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2.67~6 seconds<sup>80f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2.67~6 seconds<sup>80f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

